XLSXW_1_DEF Active   xlsx_drop_sheet              Yes   xlsx_trunc_sheet             No   xlsx_names_are_positions     No   xlsx_field_names_out         Yes   xlsx_raster_type             PNG   xlsx_table_writer_mode       Insert   "Employee Number"            number(6,version<semicolon>1<semicolon>cell_border_formatting<semicolon>NO<semicolon>text_alignment<semicolon>NO<semicolon>cell_protection<semicolon>NO)   Employee                     string(14,version<semicolon>1<semicolon>cell_border_formatting<semicolon>NO<semicolon>text_alignment<semicolon>NO<semicolon>cell_protection<semicolon>NO)   "Date Hired"                 string(20,version<semicolon>1<semicolon>cell_border_formatting<semicolon>NO<semicolon>text_alignment<semicolon>NO<semicolon>cell_protection<semicolon>NO)   Status                       string(8,version<semicolon>1<semicolon>cell_border_formatting<semicolon>NO<semicolon>text_alignment<semicolon>NO<semicolon>cell_protection<semicolon>NO)
